RezkaTV adapts the public HDrezka protocol and selectors from HDrezkaProvider:
https://github.com/hexated/cloudstream-extensions-multilingual/blob/a09f3b23f3d1c7b119fb39972e89087bdbc4eb39/HDrezkaProvider/src/main/kotlin/com/lagradost/HDrezkaProvider.kt
Copyright CloudStream HDrezkaProvider contributors, distributed under GPL-3.0.
Repository license: https://github.com/hexated/cloudstream-extensions-multilingual/blob/master/LICENSE
Port copyright (c) 2026 vladislawfox. Current public markup was checked on
rezka-tv.org. The five delimited PlayerJS noise tokens were cross-checked
against the public n0madic/go-hdrezka protocol reference; no Anubis solver or
account authentication code from that project is included.
The app's WebView runs the site's own browser check; the plugin never evaluates
remote JavaScript or implements a proof-of-work solver.

Kinogo is an original adapter, copyright (c) 2026 vladislawfox, GPL-3.0-only.
The public mobile/desktop markup at https://vprkh.kinogo.luxury/ and the
Cinemar embed's public playlist serialization and playlist/load request were
inspected to implement interoperability. No remote player implementation,
advertising code or JavaScript evaluation is bundled. Kinogo reuses this
repository's CloudStream-derived HTTP, parsing and HLS helpers (see above).
